'''Fun Pokémon Names''' (Korean: '''재미있는 포켓몬 이름들''' ''Jaemi-itneun Poketmon Ireumdeul'') is an ending theme for the Korean SBS dub of the [[original series]]. It used footage from [[Riding on Lapras]]. It is unknown when exactly this ending theme was used, though it was used as the ending of [[EP215]].

==Ending animation==
Inside an empty room a painting hangs on the wall, on the painting is a picture of {{Ash}}, {{Tracey}}, {{an|Misty}}, {{TP|Misty|Togepi}} and {{AP|Pikachu}} riding on {{AP|Lapras}}. The painting is moving, and depicts the group riding Lapras throughout the [[Orange Islands]]. As they ride across the ocean {{AP|Charizard}} flies overhead breathing fire. Gradually, the day turns to dusk. 

