==Trivia==
* A song with the same melody but with lyrics featuring {{wp|Digimon}} titled 디지디지 ''Digi Digi'' was released on the OST album for the Korean dub of ''{{wp|Digimon Adventure (1999 TV series)|Digimon Adventure}}'' in 2001. Both series were broadcast on SBS and had their music produced by Bang Yongseok of Hollywood Manner.

